@startuml SequenceDiagram_Reservation_Ticket

actor Passenger
actor Employee
participant System
participant Reservation
participant Ticket
participant Flight

Passenger -> Employee: Solicita reserva de vuelo
Employee -> System: Busca vuelos disponibles
System -> Employee: Retorna lista de vuelos
Employee -> System: Registra datos del pasajero y reserva
System -> Reservation: Crea reserva y asocia a pasajero y vuelo
System -> Ticket: Emite ticket a partir de la reserva
Employee -> Passenger: Entrega ticket

@enduml
